{"agent":"lw3-kilo","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_apply` raises `InvalidValue` for every committed `file` value of `agent.roles` / `agent.capability_verbs`, including a table that only restates the shipped default or narrows a role. Given a project config whose `[agent].roles` is `{\"operator\": [\"*\"], \"bot\": [\"read\"]}` (tighter than the default bot list, and the write path the knob docstring still documents as `ddflow config --set agent.roles ...` without `--local`), load does not keep the layer below — it aborts that knob with an operator-only error. That is not “refused, never read as the layer below said”: a clone that does not widen any token still cannot load, and a pull that merely adds those keys makes `ddflow` unusable until the committed file is hand-edited.","digest":"a39a0b38041edb85","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/config/_core.py:326","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/config/_core.py:326"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_findings":0,"delta_from":"1c90f06e92d186aaf667ddea16d644ea1851ca97","delta_raised":[],"delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":5288,"diff_sha":"cd7e7abdbf59531579b796fabbdffd126754e81599406fde0dbd8f645ee9a387","diff_source":"delta review of 2 commits since 1c90f06e92","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":250.9,"family":"xai","findings":1,"fix_round":true,"full_coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"42436fd04508313b","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-token-role-widened-by-project-config.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261111T033732Z-39fad5f1.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794368252.7341924,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}],"review_kind":"delta","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"1274baae84305e4748e742fa769b238968eb1602","reviewed_